  "Wind of Vitality Lv.$1": "",
  "Wind of Vitality <color\\=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color>": "",
  "Deal Wind damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, wtih a $2 base chance to inflict <link\\=\"s|105\"><u>Windswept</u></link> for $3 turns. then inflict <link\\=\"s|218\"><u>[Wither]</u></link>: When taking Wind damage, increase ATK for that damage, based on $5 of {{A}}'s Crit DMG that exceeds $4 (up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color> of Crit DMG). Lasts for $7 turns. Restore {{A}}'s SP by $8.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>Reflecting the rising sunlight, the fine branches are blooming with clusters of plum blossoms, and the wind is more than just a breeze, carrying the fragrance of plums over the foe.</color></size></b>": "",
  "<size\\=27>Under the Umbrella Lv.$1</size>": "",
  "<size\\=27>Under the Umbrella <color\\=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color></size>": "",
  "Increase all allies' ATK based on $2 of {{A}}'s Crit DMG that exceeds $1 (up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> of Crit DMG). Lasts for $4 turns. Then restore $5 SP. While this effect is active, when any ally deal damage with a Persona skill/Follow Up/HIGHLIGHT/{{C}}, restore {{A}}'s SP by $6, this can only activate once.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>The umbrella lightly skims through the air, bringing all the companions underneath it, leaning on each other, blessing each other with peace and tranquility, and the spring breeze knows what I mean.</color></size></b>": "",
  "<size\\=28>Fragrance of Time Lv.$1</size>": "",
  "<size\\=28>Fragrance of Time <color\\=#0F69CB>Lv.$1</color></size>": "",
  "Spend all SP, increase 1 other ally's Crit Rate by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color>. For every $2 SP spent, additionally activate the following effects at $3. Lasts for $4 turns (up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> of {{A}}'s Crit DMG): \\nSpend $6 SP: Increase ATK by $9 for every $8 Crit DMG over $7;\\nSpend $10 SP: Increase Crit DMG for every $12 Crit DMG over $11;\\nSpend $13 SP: Additionally increase Crit DMG for every $15 Crit DMG over $14.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>The cold wind is not yet finished, the dark fragrance floating, do not ask the east, do not ask the return of spring, the prosperity of all the branches in the sole beauty.</color></size></b>": "",
  "[HIGHLIGHT]: Increase 1 other ally's ATK by $3 ATK for every $2 Crit DMG over $1, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> Crit DMG. Increase their Crit DMG by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> for $6 turns. Restore $7 SP to all other allies.\\n[ONE MORE]: Deal Wind damage to 1 foe. \\nMelee Attack: Uses a melee weapon to deal light Phys damage to 1 foe. \\nGun Attack: Deal light Gun damage to 1 foe. Can fire until out of ammo.": "",
  "After Riko uses [Fragrance of Time], grant [Budding] to the main target for $1 turns.\\n[Budding]: Each time skill damage is dealt, gain $3 [Blossom] stack.\\n[Blossom]: Increase ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> for $5 turns. Stacks up to $6 times. When reaching $7 [Blossom] stacks, additionally increase ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$9</color> of the portion of Riko's Crit DMG that exceeds $8, and increase Crit DMG by <color\\=#FFFC40>$11</color> of the portion of her Crit DMG that exceeds $10. When reaching $12 [Blossom] stacks, additionally increase Crit DMG by <color\\=#FFFC40>$14</color> of the portion of her Crit DMG that exceeds $13.": "",
  "After Riko uses [Fragrance of Time], grant [Budding] to the main target for $1 turns.\\n[Budding]: Each time skill damage is dealt, gain $3 [Blossom] stack.\\n[Blossom]: Increase ATK by <color\\=#0169ca>$4</color> for $5 turns. Stacks up to $6 times. When reaching $7 [Blossom] stacks, additionally increase ATK by <color\\=#0169ca>$9</color> of the portion of Riko's Crit DMG that exceeds $8, and increase Crit DMG by <color\\=#0169ca>$11</color> of the portion of her Crit DMG that exceeds $10. When reaching $12 [Blossom] stacks, additionally increase Crit DMG by <color\\=#0169ca>$14</color> of the portion of her Crit DMG that exceeds $13.": "",
  "During battle, increase Crit DMG and HP based on Riko's SP Recovery. At a maximum of <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> SP Recovery, increase Crit DMG by <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> and HP by <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color>.": "",
  "During battle, increase Crit DMG and HP based on Riko's SP Recovery. At a maximum of <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color> SP Recovery, increase Crit DMG by <color\\=#0169ca>$2</color> and HP by <color\\=#0169ca>$3</color>.": "",
  "Allies with [Blossom] additionally increase Crit DMG by <color\\=#FFFC40>$1</color> and ATK by <color\\=#FFFC40>$3</color> for every [Blossom] stack, up to <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> Crit DMG and <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> ATK.\\nAfter Riko uses [Under the Umbrella], additionally increase all allies' Pierce by <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> and Crit Rate by <color\\=#FFFC40>$6</color> for $7 turns.": "",
  "Allies with [Blossom] additionally increase Crit DMG by <color\\=#0169ca>$1</color> and ATK by <color\\=#0169ca>$3</color> for every [Blossom] stack, up to <color\\=#0169ca>$2</color> Crit DMG and <color\\=#0169ca>$4</color> ATK.\\nAfter Riko uses [Under the Umbrella], additionally increase all allies' Pierce by <color\\=#0169ca>$5</color> and Crit Rate by <color\\=#0169ca>$6</color> for $7 turns.": "",
  "When Riko uses [Fragrance of Time], for every $1 SP spent, increase Wind allies' Total DMG Amp by <color\\=#FFFC40>$2</color> + Riko's Awareness level * $3 and DMG Bonus by <color\\=#FFFC40>$4</color> + Riko's Awareness level * <color\\=#FFFC40>$5</color> for $6 turns.\\n[Wither] additionally increase foe's Wind Crit DMG Taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>$7</color> + Riko's Awareness level * $8.": "",
  "When Riko uses [Fragrance of Time], for every $1 SP spent, increase Wind allies' Total DMG Amp by <color\\=#0169ca>$2</color> + Riko's Awareness level * $3 and DMG Bonus by <color\\=#0169ca>$4</color> + Riko's Awareness level * $5 for $6 turns.\\n[Wither] additionally increase foe's Wind Crit DMG Taken by <color\\=#0169ca>$7</color> + Riko's Awareness level * $8.": "",
